<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Theme documentation on projectious.work</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/</link><description>Recent content in Theme documentation on projectious.work</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Getting started</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/getting-started/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/getting-started/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="requirements" class="h-anchor"&gt;Requirements &lt;a href="#requirements" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Requirements"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hugo Extended, recent enough to support CSS processing and render hooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Git when installing as a module or submodule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go only when using Hugo Modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="install-as-a-hugo-module" class="h-anchor"&gt;Install as a Hugo Module &lt;a href="#install-as-a-hugo-module" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Install as a Hugo Module"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;div class="terminal"&gt;

 
 
 &lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="terminal__prompt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="terminal__cmd"&gt;hugo mod init example.com/my-site&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 

 
 
 &lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="terminal__prompt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="terminal__cmd"&gt;hugo mod get github.com/projectious-work/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 

 
 
 &lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="terminal__prompt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="terminal__cmd"&gt;hugo server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 

 
 
 &lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="terminal__ok"&gt;✓&lt;/span&gt; Web server available at http://localhost:1313/&lt;/div&gt;
 

&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add the import to &lt;code&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;toml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__filename"&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" filename="hugo.toml"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;module&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;imports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;path&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;github.com/projectious-work/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id="install-as-a-submodule" class="h-anchor"&gt;Install as a submodule &lt;a href="#install-as-a-submodule" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Install as a submodule"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;div class="terminal"&gt;

 
 
 &lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="terminal__prompt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="terminal__cmd"&gt;git submodule add https://github.com/projectious-work/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla.git themes/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 

 
 
 &lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="terminal__prompt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="terminal__cmd"&gt;hugo server&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 

&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;toml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__filename"&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" filename="hugo.toml"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;theme&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;brand-theme-hugo-vanilla&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Info&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Copy the search output and markup configuration from the bundled
&lt;code&gt;src/content/hugo.toml&lt;/code&gt;; those settings enable the search index, heading
anchors, code labels, and syntax highlighting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 id="create-content" class="h-anchor"&gt;Create content &lt;a href="#create-content" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Create content"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;
 
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;content/
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;├── _index.md
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;├── docs/
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;├── blog/
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;└── changelog/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use &lt;code&gt;hugo new docs/first-guide.md&lt;/code&gt;, add &lt;code&gt;title&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;description&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;weight&lt;/code&gt;,
then write normal Markdown. Section names select their specialized layouts.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Content model</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/content-model/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/content-model/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="sections-and-layouts" class="h-anchor"&gt;Sections and layouts &lt;a href="#sections-and-layouts" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Sections and layouts"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Content path&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Theme layout&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Use it for&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;content/_index.md&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Landing&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Hero, calls to action, overview content&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;content/docs/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Documentation&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Ordered guides with sidebar and table of contents&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;content/blog/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Blog&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Dated article index and long-form posts&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;content/changelog/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Changelog&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Versioned release timeline&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Any other section&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Default&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Pages and card-based section indexes&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="front-matter" class="h-anchor"&gt;Front matter &lt;a href="#front-matter" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Front matter"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;yaml&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__filename"&gt;content/docs/example.md&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" filename="content/docs/example.md"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Example guide&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;A one-sentence summary used in navigation and metadata.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="m"&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;comments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Blog posts also use &lt;code&gt;date&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;tags&lt;/code&gt;. Changelog entries use &lt;code&gt;date&lt;/code&gt; and
&lt;code&gt;version&lt;/code&gt;. The landing page accepts &lt;code&gt;eyebrow&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;tagline&lt;/code&gt;, and a &lt;code&gt;cta&lt;/code&gt; list.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Configuration</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/configuration/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/configuration/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="site-parameters" class="h-anchor"&gt;Site parameters &lt;a href="#site-parameters" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Site parameters"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Parameter&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Purpose&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.description&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Default description for metadata and search results.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.search.placement&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;header&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;none&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.giscus.repo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Repository used for comments; empty disables comments.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.social&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Footer links with &lt;code&gt;name&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;url&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.fonts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;bundled&lt;/code&gt; (default) or network-free &lt;code&gt;system&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.accessibility.*&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Opt-in accessibility attributes — see below.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Page &lt;code&gt;comments&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Set &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt; to suppress comments on one page.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="accessibility-attributes" class="h-anchor"&gt;Accessibility attributes &lt;a href="#accessibility-attributes" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Accessibility attributes"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The brand system ships its accessibility layer as opt-in attributes on
&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;html&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;. The theme enables the three that new work is expected to set, and
each one is configurable.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Shortcode reference</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/shortcodes/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/shortcodes/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Shortcodes are semantic additions to Markdown. Prefer Markdown for ordinary
prose, lists, tables, links, quotes, and code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="callout" class="h-anchor"&gt;Callout &lt;a href="#callout" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Callout"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parameters: &lt;code&gt;type&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;info&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;success&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;warning&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;danger&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;go-html-template&lt;/span&gt;
 
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go-html-template" data-lang="go-html-template"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="cp"&gt;{{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;callout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;warning&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cp"&gt;}}&lt;/span&gt;Back up the configuration first.&lt;span class="cp"&gt;{{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;callout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cp"&gt;}}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;

&lt;div class="callout callout--info"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Info&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Use information for relevant context.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--success"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Success&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;The build completed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--warning"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Warning&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Review the migration before applying it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;div class="callout callout--danger"&gt;
 &lt;strong class="callout__label"&gt;Danger&lt;/strong&gt;
 &lt;div class="callout__body"&gt;Deployment is blocked.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Brand provenance and fonts</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/brand-and-fonts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/brand-and-fonts/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="design-authority" class="h-anchor"&gt;Design authority &lt;a href="#design-authority" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="Design authority"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The authoritative design source is
&lt;a href="https://github.com/projectious-work/brand" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-external"&gt;&lt;code&gt;projectious-work/brand&lt;/code&gt; &lt;span class="link-external__icon"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M14 4h6v6M20 4L10 14M6 8v10h10v-4"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
. This
theme currently targets brand release &lt;code&gt;v2.1.1&lt;/code&gt; at commit
&lt;code&gt;fc8a5b5c9a063fae583b086e22a2642dd95ba284&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;src/data/brand-provenance.json&lt;/code&gt; records the source path, immutable source
revision, licence, transformation, and SHA-256 hash of every derived token,
logo, font, and font licence. Run these commands after changing brand inputs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;sh&lt;/span&gt;
 
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;



&lt;svg class="icon " width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;scripts/sync-brand-assets.py --write
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;scripts/check-brand-provenance.py&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updating the pinned brand release requires visual, accessibility, and Hugo
compatibility review. The checker rejects altered and unlisted brand artifacts;
intentional deviations belong in &lt;code&gt;semanticOverrides&lt;/code&gt; with their rationale.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Theme contract reference</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/reference/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/reference/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This reference is rendered from &lt;code&gt;src/data/product_contract.json&lt;/code&gt;, the normative
machine-readable contract released with the theme. Tutorials and examples
explain techniques; this page defines the supported public interface.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AI discovery and product MCP</title><link>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/ai-and-mcp/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://projectious-work.github.io/brand-theme-hugo-vanilla/docs/ai-and-mcp/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ai-readable-outputs" class="h-anchor"&gt;AI-readable outputs &lt;a href="#ai-readable-outputs" class="h-anchor__link" data-copy-link aria-label="AI-readable outputs"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The example site publishes a Markdown alternative for each page, a compact
&lt;code&gt;/llms.txt&lt;/code&gt; index, and a bounded &lt;code&gt;/llms-full.txt&lt;/code&gt; guide. These outputs use the
same normalized page identity, URL, language, section, and description fields
as the client-side search index and structured metadata.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Markdown output preserves the page&amp;rsquo;s source Markdown and Hugo shortcode calls.
The full guide instead uses rendered plain text so agents can consume shortcode
results without HTML navigation, scripts, or comments. Drafts and pages with
&lt;code&gt;aiExclude: true&lt;/code&gt; are omitted from the full guide.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>